menu "TC Diagnostic Console"

    config TC_DIAG_CONSOLE
        bool "Enable diagnostic console commands"
        default n
        help
            Expose low-level diagnostic commands on the TCP console.
            These commands bypass calibration and safety guards and are
            intended only for bringup/debug builds.

            Examples gated by this option:
              vdac_duty  — set VDUT PWM duty cycle directly (inverted law:
                           0% duty ≈ 10V; use vdac_voltage for safe control)

endmenu
